author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Dependency edges written through every surface, including the dep form on create and update, the blocked-by flag, update-many, copy, import and the SDK, resolve and record the same author identity that notes and comments record; source_kind is populated with the mechanism that created the edge so a backfill, an importer and an interactive write are distinguishable; an explicit author key on the dep value still overrides, and that override is marked asserted rather than detected; a check reports edges lacking attribution and the existing unattributed corpus is classified as legacy rather than silently backfilled, following the precedent for legacy history authors; regression coverage compares a dep-written edge and a flag-written edge on the same item and asserts identical attribution"
parent: pm-33cw
