environment: "pm 2026.7.26, fresh pm init"
expected_result: "Every dependency edge records who asserted it and by what mechanism, exactly as notes, comments and learnings do."
actual_result: "Edges written through the dep form carry author null and source_kind null, while the same edge kind written through the blocked-by flag is correctly attributed."
